A nested braced span hides an editorial closer

```
{-{_a-}_} b-}
.
<p><del><u>a-}</u> b</del></p>
```

```
{+x {~a+}~>c~} b+}
.
<p><ins>x <del>a+}</del><ins>c</ins> b</ins></p>
```

```
{-{+a-}+} b-}
.
<p><del><ins>a-}</ins> b</del></p>
```

```
{-{-a-}-} b-}
.
<p><del>{-a</del>-} b-}</p>
```

```
{+{-a+}-} b+}
.
<p><ins><del>a+}</del> b</ins></p>
```
